1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,230
They know your fears.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:09,250
Every morning when you wake up, there's one person waiting to challenge you.

3
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:12,160
They know your fears, your excuses,

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,250
and your untapped potential.

5
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,480
That person isn't your coworker,

6
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:19,210
your neighbor, or a stranger.

7
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,180
That person is you.

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:25,130
On one side stands the version of you who takes the easy way out.

9
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:29,510
The one who procrastinates, doubts, and hides from discomfort.

10
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:33,180
On the other side stands the version of you who is relentless,

11
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:37,120
unstoppable, and capable of achieving greatness.

12
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:41,240
The question is, which version of you will win today?

13
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:44,850
This is the most important battle you'll ever face.

14
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:46,640
You versus you.

15
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:50,810
It's a battle that shapes your happiness, success, and legacy.

16
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:53,120
Let's get one thing straight.

17
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:55,200
No one owes you anything.

18
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,220
Life doesn't owe you success.

19
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:59,790
No one is going to hand you your dreams.

20
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:01,630
There's no magical shortcut.

21
00:01:01,530 --> 00:01:04,420
No lucky break waiting just around the corner.

22
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,500
It's all on you.
